      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "If there is no matching begin\nwhen an end is encountered, an\nempty debug label with only end\ndata will be inserted",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "5ebG5laUdM3EuDCDZ9Gb8",
      "originalText": "If there is no matching begin when an end is encountered, an empty debug label with only end data will be inserted",
