      "updated": 1785775961045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applications may change the name\nor tag associated with an object\nsimply by calling\nvkSetDebugUtilsObjectNameEXT or \nvkSetDebugUtilsObjectTagEXT\nagain with a new string. If\npObjectName is either NULL or an\nempty string, then any\npreviously set name is removed.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "MZWxj2o5xGnE3iK4Lvv3X",
      "originalText": "Applications may change the name or tag associated with an object simply by calling vkSetDebugUtilsObjectNameEXT or \nvkSetDebugUtilsObjectTagEXT again with a new string. If pObjectName is either NULL or an empty string, then any previously set name is removed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
